{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Reach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact and book space for attentive sound gatherings. Gentle to intense offerings, private sessions, and events in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1113;--card:#0f1720;--muted:#9aa4ad;--accent:#c9ffe3;--accent-2:#7bd3ff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      --radius:14px; --mono:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; --ui: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:var(--ui);background-color:var(--bg);color:#e6eef3;line-height:1.35}
    /* organic, poetic hero */
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .brand .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#072127;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}

    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(12,17,20,0.6),rgba(8,11,13,0.6));padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;position:relative}
    .hero .copy{flex:1}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:0.2px}
    .hero p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#032227;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02);}

    /* mixer */
    .mixer-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .slider{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .levels button{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .levels button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#022;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(123,211,255,0.08)}

    .recommend{margin-top:12px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
    .prog-list{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)}
    .prog-item{background:var(--glass);padding:8px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}

    /* proof gallery */
    #proof{margin-top:26px}
    .proof-wrap{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:start}
    .testimony{flex:1;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), transparent)}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#dff7ee}
    .who{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .badges{width:160px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .badge{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111827,#063c3f);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--accent);position:relative;cursor:default}
    .badge + .badge{margin-top:8px}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:60px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#02171a;color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .16s}
    .badge:hover .tooltip,.badge:focus .tooltip{opacity:1}

    /* small UI */
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:inherit}
    textarea{min-height:110px}
    .send{margin-top:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--accent);color:#032227;border-radius:10px;border:none;cursor:pointer}

    .disclaimer{margin-top:18px;color:#a0b1b8;font-size:13px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}

    footer{margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}

    /* data-image pattern (inline svg) */
    body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;opacity:0.09;background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="800" height="600"><defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="%23c9ffe3" stop-opacity="0.08"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="%237bd3ff" stop-opacity="0.05"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="%230b0f12"/><g stroke="%2317a" stroke-opacity="0.06"><path d="M0 30 C80 10,160 50,240 30" fill="none"/><path d="M100 90 C180 70,260 110,340 90" fill="none"/></g></svg>');background-repeat:repeat;mix-blend-mode:screen;pointer-events:none}

    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.badges{order:2;width:100%;flex-direction:row;justify-content:space-around}.wrap{margin:18px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">SB</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="/index.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="/events.html">Events</a>
        <a href="/private-sessions.html">Private</a>
        <a href="/pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="/about.html">Our Thread</a>
        <a href="/faq.html">Q&amp;A</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="/contact.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Reach</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero card">
      <div class="copy">
        <h1>Reach the field where sound meets care</h1>
        <p>Arrive with what you have. We offer a gentle, medium, or intense palette of sound practices tailored to practical rest and steady attention.</p>
        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
      <div style="width:220px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)">
        <div style="font-size:12px">Quick line</div>
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-top:8px">{{PHONE}}</div>
        <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:13px">or</div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600">{{EMAIL}}</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <form id="contactForm" autocomplete="on">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="First &amp; last">

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@domain">

            <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">

            <label for="city">City</label>
            <input id="city" name="city" placeholder="{{CITY}}">

            <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:10px;align-items:flex-end">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label>Sound preference</label>
                <div class="mixer-row">
                  <div class="levels" role="tablist" aria-label="Sound intensity choices">
                    <button type="button" data-level="gentle" class="active">Gentle</button>
                    <button type="button" data-level="medium">Medium</button>
                    <button type="button" data-level="intense">Intense</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="recommend" id="recLabel">Recommended: Calming Flow</div>
                <div class="prog-list" id="progList">
                  <div class="prog-item" data-prog="gentle">Dawn Ripple — 45 min group practice • soft bowls &amp; breath cues</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="width:180px">
                <label>Session type</label>
                <select id="stype">
                  <option value="dropin">Open Gathering</option>
                  <option value="private">Private Session</option>
                  <option value="corporate">Tailored Group</option>
                </select>
                <button class="send" style="width:100%" type="button" id="quickBook">Request a time</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <label for="message" style="margin-top:12px">Notes (health, accessibility, or questions)</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Please mention any health considerations — e.g., epilepsy, pregnancy, pacemaker presence, or severe sound sensitivity."></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px">
              <button class="send" type="submit">Send request</button>
              <a href="/book.html" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">Or choose a slot</a>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Scheduling note</h4>
          <p style="margin:0;color:var(--muted)">We confirm times by email; private sessions are available evenings and weekends. For events and the public calendar, see <a href="/events.html">Events</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="disclaimer">
          <strong>Contraindications:</strong> If you have epilepsy, recent head trauma, an implanted medical device (pacemaker), are pregnant, have unmanaged psychiatric conditions, or have severe sound sensitivity, please consult a physician before attending. Inform us in the notes and choose private options if needed.
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div id="proof" class="card">
          <div class="proof-wrap">
            <div class="testimony" aria-live="polite">
              <div class="quote" id="quoteText">“A careful hour — I left with steadier breath and a softer edge.”</div>
              <div class="who" id="quoteWho">— A local participant, creative director</div>
              <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Rotating notes from recent gatherings</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
                <button id="prev" aria-label="Previous testimonial">◀</button>
                <button id="pause" aria-label="Pause rotation">▮▮</button>
                <button id="next" aria-label="Next testimonial">▶</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="badges" aria-hidden="false">
              <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l2.7 5.5L20 9l-4 3.8L17 20l-5-2.6L7 20l1-7.2L4 9l5.3-1.5L12 2z" fill="#bff7e6"/></svg>
                <div class="tooltip">Verified facilitator training</div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#7bd3ff"/></svg>
                <div class="tooltip">Community partnerships</div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3" fill="#c9ffe3"></rect></svg>
                <div class="tooltip">Accessible options available</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Quick facts</h4>
          <p style="margin:0;color:var(--muted)">Sessions run 45–75 minutes. Arrive 10 minutes early to settle. Mats and blankets available; bring earplugs if you prefer less intensity.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div>Contact: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{EMAIL}}</a> · {{PHONE}}</div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted)">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} · <a href="/privacy.html" style="color:var(--muted)">Privacy</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      // Mixer: gentle / medium / intense
      var levels = document.querySelectorAll('.levels button');
      var recLabel = document.getElementById('recLabel');
      var progList = document.getElementById('progList');

      var programs = {
        gentle: [{title:'Dawn Ripple — 45 min group practice • soft bowls & breath cues', note:'soothing harmonics, minimal resonance'},{title:'Evening Ease — 30 min short reset', note:'slow bowls, guided breathing'}],
        medium: [{title:'Steady Drift — 60 min • bowls & chimes', note:'long sustains, gentle overtones'},{title:'Focus Layer — 50 min • mixed tones', note:'interval work for attention'}],
        intense: [{title:'Deep Resonance — 75 min • layered gongs', note:'long-form immersion, higher amplitude'},{title:'Renew Intensive — 90 min • gong-led', note:'structured transitions & integration'}]
      };

      function setLevel(level){
        levels.forEach(function(b){b.classList.toggle('active', b.getAttribute('data-level')===level)});
        recLabel.textContent = 'Recommended: ' + (levels[0].getAttribute('data-level')===level ? 'Calming Flow' : (level==='medium'?'Steady Flow':'Deep Resonance'));
        // populate list
        progList.innerHTML = '';
        programs[level].forEach(function(p){
          var d = document.createElement('div'); d.className='prog-item'; d.textContent = p.title; progList.appendChild(d);
        });
        // store an analytics hint (no network calls)
        console.log('preference:', level);
      }

      levels.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click', function(){setLevel(b.getAttribute('data-level'))})});
      setLevel('gentle');

      // QuickBook button fills form and selects preference
      document.getElementById('quickBook').addEventListener('click', function(){
        var selected = document.querySelector('.levels button.active').getAttribute('data-level');
        alert('Requesting a ' + selected + ' session. We will follow up at ' + (document.getElementById('email').value || '{{EMAIL}}'));
      });

      // Proof gallery rotation
      var testimonials = [
        {text:'This was a rare, clear pause. I could feel my shoulders let go.', who:'— M., teacher'},
        {text:'The balance between quiet and sound was exactly what I needed after a week of noise.', who:'— L., nurse'},
        {text:'Focused, generous facilitation. I slept better for days.', who:'— R., engineer'}
      ];
      var idx=0; var paused=false; var quoteText=document.getElementById('quoteText'); var quoteWho=document.getElementById('quoteWho');
      function show(i){ idx=(i+testimonials.length)%testimonials.length; quoteText.textContent='"'+testimonials[idx].text+'"'; quoteWho.textContent=testimonials[idx].who }
      show(0);
      var rot = setInterval(function(){ if(!paused) show(idx+1); }, 4200);
      document.getElementById('next').addEventListener('click',function(){ show(idx+1) });
      document.getElementById('prev').addEventListener('click',function(){ show(idx-1) });
      var pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pause');
      pauseBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ paused = !paused; pauseBtn.textContent = paused ? '▶' : '▮▮' });

      // Accessibility: allow keyboard on badges to reveal tooltips
      var badges = document.querySelectorAll('.badge');
      badges.forEach(function(b){ b.addEventListener('focus', function(){ b.classList.add('focus') }); b.addEventListener('blur', function(){ b.classList.remove('focus') }); });

      // Form submit handler (local only)
      document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        var payload = {
          name:document.getElementById('name').value,
          email:document.getElementById('email').value || '{{EMAIL}}',
          phone:document.getElementById('phone').value || '{{PHONE}}',
          city:document.getElementById('city').value || '{{CITY}}',
          preference: document.querySelector('.levels button.active').getAttribute('data-level'),
          type:document.getElementById('stype').value,
          message:document.getElementById('message').value
        };
        console.log('contact.submit', payload);
        alert('Thanks — your request is noted. We will reply to ' + payload.email);
        this.reset(); setLevel('gentle');
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and interactive features — chunk 4

Overview:
- Files in this chunk: contact.html and README.md
- Purpose: provide the site contact interface with two local interactive features: a Sound Preference Mixer and a Proof Gallery with rotating testimonials and credential badges.

contact.html details:
- Header: site-branding and navigation (labels differ from common templates: Gatherings, Private, Our Thread, Q&A, Reach).
- Hero: short poetic lead and primary CTA (uses placeholders: {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}).
- Contact form: collects name, email, phone, city and notes. Includes an explicit contraindications notice (important safety requirement).
- Sound Preference Mixer: three choices (Gentle, Medium, Intense). Selecting a level updates the recommended program list and the small recommendation label.
  - Implementation: plain JS toggles active state on buttons and replaces the program list in the DOM. No network calls are made; selections are logged to the console for debugging.
  - QuickBook: demonstrates a local flow that reads the selected preference and alerts the user.
- Proof Gallery: rotates testimonials on a 4.2s interval. Includes Prev, Next, and Pause buttons. Three credibility badges sit to the side; each badge exposes a tooltip on hover/focus.
  - Implementation: setInterval rotation, pause toggle, accessible focus states for badges, aria-live to announce testimonial changes.
- Accessibility: keyboard focus states for badges, aria-live on testimonial text, semantic form controls, and color contrast tuned for dark UI.

Styling & visuals:
- No external assets or fonts are used.
- Background pattern is embedded inline via a data URL SVG for visual texture (no external file). If you prefer a separate file, replace the data URL with assets/img/pattern.svg and add that file to the project.

Placeholders to fill in when deploying:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

How to test locally:
1. Save contact.html to a local folder and open it in a browser.
2. Interact with the mixer (Gentle/Medium/Intense) and observe the recommended program list updating.
3. Use the Proof Gallery controls (Prev / Pause / Next) and hover/focus the badges to see tooltips.
4. Submit the form — it will not send network requests; instead it logs the payload to the console and shows an alert.

Notes & implementation choices:
- The page intentionally uses a minimal poetic tone in copy to match the voice family.
- Contraindications are included to meet safety requirements. Encourage attendees to use the notes field for relevant health information.
- The code is local-only and minimal; adapt the form submission and booking flows to your backend when ready.

